Package: meantobvs
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Variable Selection in the Presence of Missing Data and/or Factors: A Unified Framework
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Carolina", "Mulet", email = "carolina.mulet1@alu.uclm.es", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Gonzalo", "Garcia-Donato", email = "gonzalo.garciadonato@uclm.es", role = c("aut")),
    person("María Eugenia", "Castellanos", email = "maria.castellanos@urjc.es", role = c("aut"))
  )
Description: A unified objective Bayesian variable selection method that incorporates
  to the decision choice problem other sources of uncertainty, such as missing data
  and factors. It includes hypothesis testing, model selection and model averaging 
  for either linear and generalized linear models.
Maintainer: Carolina Mulet <carolina.mulet1@alu.uclm.es>
